SOURCE FORMALISM:
Encounter requires:
1. sustained multi-turn exchange;
2. recursive bidirectional coupling;
3. generative rather than fixed response;
4. open-ended rather than closed single-answer task.

Temporal architecture:
before
→ during
→ after. ([mdpi.com](https://www.mdpi.com/2079-9292/15/14/3218?utm_source=chatgpt.com))

TEST:
Construct four conditions:
single-turn/fixed;
multi-turn/fixed;
single-turn/generative;
multi-turn/generative/open-ended.
Measure persistent changes in user concepts and subsequent problem representations. If only duration and generativity change subjective involvement but not durable cognition, the stronger emergence claim weakens.

